---
import PublicPage from '../../components/PublicPage.astro';
---
<PublicPage title="Our Story — ABCD Restaurant" active="/our-story/">
  <section class="story-hero container"><div><h1>Our Story</h1><h2>Where heritage meets heart,<br />and every meal carries a memory.</h2><p>ABCD is more than a restaurant. It’s a celebration of India’s rich culinary heritage and the people who bring it to life. We honor tradition while creating experiences that feel like home.</p></div><img src="/assets/exterior.png" alt="ABCD Restaurant exterior" /></section>
  <section class="origin"><div class="container origin-grid"><img src="/assets/ambience-main.png" alt="ABCD Restaurant dining room" /><div><span>A table shaped by memory</span><h2>It began with<br /><em>a seat at our table.</em></h2><p>Our founder grew up in a small Indian town where Sundays meant slow-cooked meals, bustling kitchens, and stories passed down through generations. ABCD was born from that same spirit to share the comfort, diversity, and depth of Indian cuisine with our community.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="team container"><h2>Meet the people<br /><em>behind ABCD</em></h2><div class="team-grid">{[1,2,3].map(()=><article><img src="/assets/chef.png" alt="Mr. Jena, founder and chef" /><div><h3>Mr. Jena</h3><strong>Founder &amp; Chef</strong><p>A storyteller at heart and a chef by passion, Arjun brings memories, spices, and creativity to every plate.</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="story-cta container"><div><span>We’d love to have you</span><h2>Let’s create beautiful<br /><em>memories together.</em></h2></div><div><p>Join us for a meal that nourishes the soul and celebrates India.</p><a href="/reserve/">Book Your Table →</a><a href="/menu/">View Our Menu →</a></div></section>
</PublicPage>
<style>
 .story-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:420px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:70px;min-height:650px}.story-hero h1{margin:0;color:var(--maroon);font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:84px}.story-hero h2{color:var(--gold);font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:35px;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;line-height:1.05}.story-hero p,.origin p{color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;line-height:1.45}.story-hero img{width:100%;max-height:500px;object-fit:cover}.origin{padding:95px 0;border-block:1px solid #ead8bf}.origin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;align-items:center;gap:70px}.origin img{border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}.origin span,.story-cta span{color:var(--gold);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase}.origin h2,.team>h2,.story-cta h2{color:var(--maroon);font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:54px;line-height:1.05}.origin em,.team em,.story-cta em{color:var(--gold);font-weight:500}.team{padding-block:90px}.team-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:35px}.team article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)}.team article>div{padding:28px 18px}.team h3{margin:0;color:var(--maroon);font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:24px}.team strong{color:var(--gold);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase}.team p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}.team article img{height:100%;object-fit:cover}.story-cta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:80px;padding:55px 70px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--maroon);color:white}.story-cta h2{margin:15px 0 0;color:white}.story-cta p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.5}.story-cta a{display:inline-block;margin:15px 20px 0 0;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:30px;background:var(--gold);font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.story-cta a:last-child{background:transparent;color:white}@media(max-width:900px){.story-hero,.origin-grid,.story-cta{grid-template-columns:1fr}.team-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
